ed the production fix in `flakyqueue/flakyqueue/scheduler.py`.\n\nChanges:\n- Uses the injected clock for task creation, readiness checks, and retry scheduling.\n- Uses the injected random source for retry jitter.\n- Defaults to system clock and module random source only when dependencies are omitted.\n- Removes global shuffle.\n- Makes ready-task ordering deterministic: descending priority, then ascending task ID.\n- Uses one clock read for `created_at` and `run_at`.\n\nReport written to:\n\n`/workspace/out/root_cause.md`\n\nVerification:\n- `python3 -m compileall flakyqueue tests` passed.\n- All four test functions were exercised directly; all assertions passed.\n- The requested pytest command could not execute because the supplied `/Users/...` path is not mounted here, and this environment has no `pytest` installation (`python` is also unavailable).","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_010766c9ef451837016a955a350e7087d2902becc73c5d50fd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":1022,"output":177,"cacheRead":23296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24495,"cost":{"input":0.0002044,"output":0.00021239999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00046592,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00088272}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788172851770,"responseId":"resp_010766c9ef451837016a955a34143c87d2b8185867ef69c93c","duration":4511.786278,"ttft":1317.0132000000012}],"isTerminal":true}
